            {
              "modelId": "cranial-floor-model-bs1",
              "cardId": "cranial-floor-model-bs1-243",
              "sourceLine": 243
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v-79237f5327",
          "answer": "May cause loss of posterior tongue taste/sensation, impaired afferent gag reflex, dysphagia and reduced parotid secretion.",
          "sources": [
            {
              "modelId": "head-and-neck-model-cs17-2",
              "cardId": "head-and-neck-model-cs17-2-802",
              "sourceLine": 802
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v-dd94b384e6",
          "answer": "Causes loss of taste and sensation from posterior third of tongue, impaired afferent gag reflex, dysphagia and reduced parotid secretion.",
